{"id": "story_food_objects_0009", "text": "Elle enfile un tablier et allume la bouilloire pour préparer un thé.", "spans": [{"start": 15, "end": 22, "label": "hint_object_generic", "text": "tablier"}, {"start": 36, "end": 46, "label": "hint_tool", "text": "bouilloire"}, {"start": 64, "end": 67, "label": "hint_food", "text": "thé"}], "meta": {"lang": "fr", "source": "synthetic_story", "offsets": "0-based, end exclusive"}}
{"id": "story_food_objects_0010", "text": "Dans la casserole, elle fait mijoter une soupe de lentilles avec des carottes.", "spans": [{"start": 8, "end": 17, "label": "hint_tool", "text": "casserole"}, {"start": 41, "end": 46, "label": "hint_food", "text": "soupe"}, {"start": 50, "end": 59, "label": "hint_food", "text": "lentilles"}, {"start": 69, "end": 77, "label": "hint_food", "text": "carottes"}], "meta": {"lang": "fr", "source": "synthetic_story", "offsets": "0-based, end exclusive"}}
